{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16549","headline":"寄邵校书楚苌 · 陈翊","name":"寄邵校书楚苌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱酒时称僻，高情自不凡。\n向人方白眼，违俗有青岩。\n云际开三径，烟中挂一帆。\n相期同岁晚，闲兴与松杉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈翊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}